{"id": "city-college-findings-that-came-back", "title": "City College auditors: faculty paid for a full load they did not teach, four years running", "seconds": 138.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "b721241760e1fc97", "words": 409, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[0]", "timeline[2]", "timeline[4]", "timeline[8]"], "text": "2018. 2019. 2020. 2021.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.93, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["2018", "2019", "2020", "2021"], "sub": "Load Banking: one audit finding, four years running"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.95, 1.11, 1.96, 2.18, 2.96, 3.15]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[0]"], "text": "Four years in a row, City College’s auditors reported the same finding.", "t0": 4.35, "t1": 7.85, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "City College of San Francisco", "kicker": "The independent auditors", "sub": "one finding, every year"}, "emph": ["Four years"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.4, 0.55, 0.65, 0.93, 1.12, 1.52, 1.93, 2.34, 2.55, 2.87]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "oneLine"], "text": "Faculty paid full salary while teaching less than a full load.", "t0": 7.97, "t1": 10.71, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "paid full salary while teaching less than a full load"}, "emph": ["full salary"], "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.6, 0.83, 1.26, 1.46, 1.75, 1.98, 2.06, 2.14, 2.36]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["status", "established[0]"], "text": "These are official audit findings, in the auditors’ own words.", "t0": 10.83, "t1": 13.84, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Official findings", "sub": "the auditors’ own words, in the college’s annual audits"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.19, 0.59, 0.87, 1.53, 1.63, 1.71, 2.2, 2.41]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "count", "ref": ["established[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "Across 7 audits, the auditors made 36 findings. 12 came back in two or more years.", "t0": 14.06, "t1": 19.17, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "36", "label": "findings in 7 audits", "sub": "12 made in two or more years"}, "emph": ["36"], "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.61, 1.05, 1.11, 1.53, 1.77, 2.27, 3.13, 3.5, 3.65, 3.88, 4.06, 4.28, 4.44, 4.61]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "count", "ref": ["story[2]"], "text": "The longest-running: load banking, and the district’s own financial condition.", "t0": 19.29, "t1": 23.05, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "36", "label": "findings in 7 audits", "sub": "12 made in two or more years"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.72, 1.2, 1.97, 2.03, 2.12, 2.55, 2.8, 3.26]}, {"scene": "load", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[3]", "story[1]"], "text": "Load banking is a faculty benefit: teach extra now, take paid time off later.", "t0": 23.27, "t1": 27.37, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Teach extra now", "sub": "bank the hours"}, {"art": "calendar", "name": "Take paid time off later", "sub": "drawn from the bank"}], "kicker": "How load banking works"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.47, 0.66, 0.79, 1.01, 1.73, 1.94, 2.23, 2.72, 2.87, 3.08, 3.34, 3.56]}, {"scene": "load", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[3]", "suspicious[0].what"], "text": "The finding: the bank ran the other way. Time off came before the hours were taught.", "t0": 27.49, "t1": 31.89, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the bank ran the other way"}, "emph": ["the other way"], "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.56, 0.9, 1.14, 1.41, 1.49, 1.73, 2.33, 2.66, 2.9, 3.11, 3.43, 3.58, 3.89, 4.04]}, {"scene": "load", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "established[0]", "actors[2]"], "text": "By June 2021, faculty owed back 707,924 dollars.", "t0": 32.01, "t1": 37.71, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$707,924", "label": "owed back by faculty, June 2021"}, "emph": ["707,924"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.44, 0.7, 1.38, 1.77, 2.0, 2.31, 2.57, 2.86, 3.19, 3.69, 4.11, 4.46, 5.07]}, {"scene": "load", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Paying for teaching not done is a cost to the college’s public funding.", "t0": 38.23, "t1": 41.44, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the control was not fixed in that time"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.37, 0.73, 0.99, 1.27, 1.43, 1.53, 1.82, 1.9, 2.04, 2.57, 2.84]}, {"scene": "load", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Repeated four years, it means the control wasn’t fixed in that time.", "t0": 41.56, "t1": 44.77, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the control was not fixed in that time"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.67, 1.16, 1.23, 1.42, 1.52, 1.92, 2.26, 2.56, 2.63, 2.8]}, {"scene": "load", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "State pay files show overtime at 12.8 percent of wages in 2021, first of 52 districts.", "t0": 44.89, "t1": 51.05, "shot": "b8a", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "12.8%", "label": "of wages paid as overtime, 2021", "sub": "first of 52 community college districts; the middle district paid 1.5%"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.4, 0.66, 0.88, 1.44, 1.65, 1.89, 2.23, 2.33, 2.67, 2.83, 3.27, 3.38, 3.58, 4.47, 4.76, 4.93, 5.48]}, {"scene": "finance", "kind": "form", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "timeline[1]", "timeline[3]", "timeline[5]", "timeline[9]"], "text": "In each of those years, the college’s own finances were rated a material weakness.", "t0": 51.27, "t1": 55.73, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "Financial Condition of the District", "rows": [["2018", "material weakness"], ["2019", "material weakness"], ["2020", "material weakness"], ["2021", "material weakness"]]}, "emph": ["material weakness"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.27, 0.35, 0.57, 1.02, 1.16, 1.72, 1.98, 2.56, 2.76, 3.05, 3.19, 3.85]}, {"scene": "finance", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "A district whose auditors doubt its finances has less room to absorb losses from weak controls.", "t0": 55.85, "t1": 60.86, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "less room to absorb money lost to weak controls"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.39, 0.72, 1.18, 1.44, 1.6, 2.17, 2.52, 2.78, 2.98, 3.12, 3.48, 3.96, 4.12, 4.41]}, {"scene": "federal", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "amount"], "text": "Then federal grants. The auditors questioned 501,648 dollars of costs.", "t0": 61.08, "t1": 66.82, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$501,648", "label": "questioned costs on federal programs", "sub": "fiscal 2020 and 2021"}, "emph": ["501,648"], "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.7, 1.21, 1.56, 1.95, 2.43, 2.67, 2.9, 3.1, 3.65, 3.88, 4.18, 4.7, 5.07, 5.19]}, {"scene": "federal", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "timeline[10]", "timeline[6]", "timeline[7]"], "text": "Most of it, 427,867 dollars, in one 2021 finding on allowable costs.", "t0": 67.24, "t1": 74.1, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Questioned costs by finding, dollars", "rows": [["2021-004, allowable costs", "427867"], ["2020-006, allowable costs", "62206"], ["2020-004, cash management", "11575"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.29, 0.74, 0.88, 1.16, 1.75, 2.1, 2.41, 2.72, 3.37, 4.0, 4.11, 4.36, 4.68, 5.17, 5.67, 5.88, 6.27]}, {"scene": "federal", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "That was pandemic relief: indirect costs charged at the 10 percent default rate, not the negotiated one.", "t0": 74.22, "t1": 79.47, "shot": "b12a", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the 10% default rate instead of its negotiated rate", "kicker": "Finding 2021-004: pandemic relief"}, "emph": ["pandemic relief"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.31, 0.78, 1.37, 1.8, 2.23, 2.55, 2.61, 2.71, 2.9, 3.23, 3.56, 4.12, 4.36, 4.5, 5.04]}, {"scene": "federal", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The college’s own federal reports show 511,662 dollars of indirect costs charged that year.", "t0": 79.59, "t1": 86.46, "shot": "b12c", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$511,662", "label": "indirect costs charged to the relief, 2021", "sub": "the college’s own report to the U.S. Department of Education"}, "emph": ["511,662"], "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.46, 0.65, 1.01, 1.54, 1.86, 2.1, 2.31, 2.61, 3.24, 3.37, 3.7, 4.26, 4.78, 5.05, 5.5, 5.99, 6.37, 6.53]}, {"scene": "federal", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The 2022 audit lists it as implemented. It doesn’t say whether money was returned.", "t0": 86.58, "t1": 90.73, "shot": "b12b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Finding 2021-004", "sub": "listed as implemented in the 2022 audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.24, 0.6, 0.92, 1.19, 1.35, 1.53, 2.3, 2.5, 2.71, 2.85, 3.12, 3.4, 3.61]}, {"scene": "federal", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "A 2020 finding questioned 62,206 dollars more.", "t0": 90.85, "t1": 95.05, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Questioned costs by finding, dollars", "rows": [["2021-004, allowable costs", "427867"], ["2020-006, allowable costs", "62206"], ["2020-004, cash management", "11575"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.3, 0.59, 1.05, 1.59, 2.05, 2.5, 2.65, 3.07, 3.33, 3.85]}, {"scene": "federal", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Another questioned 11,575.", "t0": 95.17, "t1": 98.25, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Questioned costs by finding, dollars", "rows": [["2021-004, allowable costs", "427867"], ["2020-006, allowable costs", "62206"], ["2020-004, cash management", "11575"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.79, 1.17, 1.55, 1.9, 2.18]}, {"scene": "federal", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "innocent[0]"], "text": "Questioned costs aren’t losses yet. A grantor can disallow them and ask for the money back.", "t0": 98.37, "t1": 102.72, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a grantor can disallow them and ask for the money back"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.7, 1.0, 1.45, 1.9, 2.1, 2.43, 2.58, 2.97, 3.18, 3.38, 3.56, 3.68, 3.75, 3.93]}, {"scene": "hours", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "One more, from 2015. Attendance hours were overstated, with a 2.14 percent error rate.", "t0": 102.94, "t1": 108.88, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Finding 2015-006", "sub": "contact hours overstated, 2.14% error rate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.43, 0.56, 0.78, 1.36, 2.33, 2.71, 2.91, 3.68, 3.8, 3.9, 4.06, 4.38, 4.59, 4.86, 5.31, 5.6]}, {"scene": "hours", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "Extrapolated: 31,826 contact hours.", "t0": 109.0, "t1": 113.44, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "31,826", "label": "contact hours, extrapolated", "sub": "60.62 FTES"}, "emph": ["31,826"], "wt": [0.0, 0.71, 1.34, 1.69, 2.01, 2.36, 3.25, 3.84]}, {"scene": "hours", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "actors[4]"], "text": "The State pays by attendance, so overstated hours draw money the college didn’t earn.", "t0": 113.86, "t1": 118.06, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "31,826", "label": "contact hours, extrapolated", "sub": "60.62 FTES"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.24, 0.44, 0.58, 1.26, 1.45, 2.0, 2.4, 2.72, 3.03, 3.17, 3.5, 3.8]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "What the records don’t show: whether the deficit was recovered, or the costs repaid.", "t0": 118.28, "t1": 122.63, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Whether the load-banking deficit was recovered", "Whether the questioned costs were repaid or disallowed", "Whether the findings closed after 2021"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.26, 0.7, 0.92, 1.62, 1.82, 1.92, 2.3, 2.45, 3.16, 3.22, 3.34, 3.78]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Or whether the findings closed after 2021.", "t0": 122.75, "t1": 125.34, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Whether the load-banking deficit was recovered", "Whether the questioned costs were repaid or disallowed", "Whether the findings closed after 2021"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.55, 0.68, 1.05, 1.49, 1.74, 1.95]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The later audits’ prior-findings pages, and the load-bank recovery records.", "t0": 125.46, "t1": 130.34, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The 2022 to 2024 audits’ status-of-prior-findings pages"}, {"who": "", "what": "The load-bank reconciliation and recovery records"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.23, 0.44, 0.73, 1.17, 1.38, 1.78, 2.54, 3.18, 3.37, 3.52, 3.98, 4.39]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "innocent[0]", "innocent[1]"], "text": "A repeat finding can be partly corrected. And the deficits are small against the college’s payroll.", "t0": 130.46, "t1": 135.13, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.37, 0.72, 0.91, 1.04, 1.31, 2.0, 2.42, 2.52, 2.95, 3.07, 3.43, 3.68, 3.77, 4.17]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 135.25, "t1": 137.12, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.5, 0.63, 0.9, 1.01, 1.1, 1.3, 1.51]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Four years running", "found": "What the auditors found", "load": "Load banking", "finance": "The finances", "federal": "Federal money", "hours": "Attendance hours", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "timeline"}